        "updated_at": "2026-10-30T14:57:40.101632+00:00",
        "chunk_id": "2374aba0-df47-5541-9aee-ce73a6670ccf",
        "anchor": "birch-working-note-1",
        "heading": "Birch working note 1",
        "content": "Birch Kite completed 80 deliveries in March. This count includes only\ncompleted deliveries, not cancelled bookings.\n\nTo prepare the shared working folder, staff place the latest notes beside the intake\nsheet and retain the previous copy in the archive. A coordinator checks the file\nname and the date before the next handoff. If a document is missing, the team\nrecords that gap and asks for the original; a replacement is not assumed to exist.",
        "kind": "source_chunk",
        "last_scan_at": "2026-10-30T14:57:40.102985+00:00",
        "freshness": "recent",
        "uncertainty": "Source text has not been reviewed.",
        "citation_id": "source:2374aba0-df47-5541-9aee-ce73a6670ccf:36624e33-edce-54f3-bf53-13710b138f77",
        "presented_content": "Birch Kite completed 80 deliveries in March. This count includes only\ncompleted deliveries, not cancelled bookings.\n\nTo prepare the shared working folder, staff place the latest notes beside the intake\nsheet and retain the previous copy in the archive. A coordinator checks the file\nname and the date before the next handoff. If a document is missing, the team\nrecords that gap and asks for the original; a replacement is not assumed to exist."
      },
      {
        "collection_id": "a0aed607-10ec-406b-82c3-b4bfcb97da1a",
        "document_id": "f0b74e48-9d23-592f-8f91-e50c5d1dd2e7",
