        "relative_path": "sources/birch_c.md",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-30T14:57:40.102901+00:00",
        "chunk_id": "8082b57a-9ce6-592e-a9df-efd2c871973b",
        "anchor": "birch-working-note-3",
        "heading": "Birch working note 3",
        "content": "The operations team stores monthly delivery summaries by calendar month. Use\nthe completed count, rather than the number of bookings, when comparing\nperiods.\n\nThe office keeps a separate log for day-to-day questions. Each entry contains the\ndate received and a brief description, followed by the initials of the person\nwho filed it. Entries are reviewed in batches, and outdated drafts stay labeled\nas drafts until someone supplies a verified replacement.",
        "kind": "source_chunk",
        "last_scan_at": "2026-10-30T14:57:40.102985+00:00",
