        "uncertainty": "Source text has not been reviewed.",
        "citation_id": "source:8082b57a-9ce6-592e-a9df-efd2c871973b:629884e3-e3be-593c-b728-aeef436642fd",
        "presented_content": "The operations team stores monthly delivery summaries by calendar month. Use\nthe completed count, rather than the number of bookings, when comparing\nperiods.\n\nThe office keeps a separate log for day-to-day questions. Each entry contains the\ndate received and a brief description, followed by the initials of the person\nwho filed it. Entries are reviewed in batches, and outdated drafts stay labeled\nas drafts until someone supplies a verified replacement."
      }
